# configure/cloud-sync.md: the cloud rows on GAME SETTINGS, the cloud hub,
# the tick page behind BACK UP TO THE CLOUD, and CONNECT OR REPAIR CLOUD
# STORAGE. START opens MAIN MENU on GAME SETTINGS (signed out); GAME SETTINGS
# opens on its first row, and up wraps through BACK and PER SYSTEM ADVANCED
# CONFIGURATION to MANAGE CLOUD STORAGE, the last row of the CLOUD SETTINGS
# group. On the hub, BACK UP TO THE CLOUD is the first row and CONNECT OR
# REPAIR CLOUD STORAGE the eighth press down (CONNECTED TO is a focus stop).
key ret
wait-for-change 30 0
settle
key x
wait-for-change 30 0
settle
key up
wait-for-change 30 0
key up
wait-for-change 30 0
key up
wait-for-change 30 0
settle
shot game-settings-cloud-rows
key x
wait-for-change 30 0
settle
shot cloud-hub
key x
wait-for-change 30 0
settle
shot back-up-to-the-cloud
key z
wait-for-change 30 0
settle
key down
wait-for-change 30 0
key down
wait-for-change 30 0
key down
wait-for-change 30 0
key down
wait-for-change 30 0
key down
wait-for-change 30 0
key down
wait-for-change 30 0
key down
wait-for-change 30 0
key down
wait-for-change 30 0
settle
key x
wait-for-change 30 0
settle
shot connect-or-repair-cloud-storage
dismiss-dialogs
